{"book":"kinney","chapter":"storybook","chapterTitle":"بناء أنظمة التصميم في Storybook","slug":"adding-button-sizes-solution","title":"الحل: إضافة متغيّرات أحجام الأزرار وأدوات التحكم","headings":[],"html":"<p>يجدر بنا على الأرجح أن نحدّث المكوّن أيضًا، أليس كذلك؟</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ComponentProps</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;react&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> clsx <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;clsx&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> styles <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;./button.module.css&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ButtonProps</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ComponentProps</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;button&#x27;</span>&gt; &amp; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">variant</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;primary&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;secondary&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;destructive&#x27;</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">size</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;small&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;medium&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;large&#x27;</span>;\n};\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Button</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">{ variant = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;primary&#x27;</span>, size = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;medium&#x27;</span>, ...props }: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ButtonProps</span></span>) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{clsx(styles.button,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">styles</span>[<span class=\"hljs-attr\">variant</span>], <span class=\"hljs-attr\">styles</span>[<span class=\"hljs-attr\">size</span>])} {<span class=\"hljs-attr\">...props</span>} /&gt;</span></span>;\n};\n</code></pre>\n<p>وأخيرًا، نحتاج إلى إضافة قصص إضافية لأحجام أزرارنا.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Small</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Story</span> = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">children</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Button&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;small&#x27;</span>,\n  },\n};\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Medium</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Story</span> = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">children</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Button&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;medium&#x27;</span>,\n  },\n};\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Large</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Story</span> = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">children</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Button&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;large&#x27;</span>,\n  },\n};\n</code></pre>\n<p>كما وعدنا، حان وقت الحديث عن <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/courses/storybook/default-args\">الوسائط الافتراضية</a>.</p>\n"}